0..77 Comment "// A body whose tail is a lambda, with no `return` before it, is refused with"
78..154 Comment "// `ShapeMismatch`. The declared result is a thunk of a function, and a bare"
155..233 Comment "// lambda is a computation of a function type. The tail stands at the end of a"
234..307 Comment "// body, after a `let`, at the end of a block, and in one arm of a match."
